    "title": "Batavia Mayor Tom Drish Steps Down After More Than 20 Years of Service; Aric Jensen Appointed - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By AJ Roe ,\n7 hours ago The City of Batavia is under new leadership following the resignation of longtime Mayor Tom Drish, with Aric Jensen appointed to serve as his successor. Drish officially stepped down from the position on April 1st, ending more than two decades of service to the community. His public service included over 20 years with the city and five years on the Cardinal School Board. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
